    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-window-assumption",
        "moduleId": "window-and-question",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材设定：标准位置的矩形裁剪窗口",
        "markdown": "教材在讨论二维点裁剪时假设裁剪窗口是一个位于标准位置的矩形。判断的对象是单个点 $P=(x,y)$，要回答的问题是：这个点是否落在矩形窗口内、是否应当保存下来用于显示。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000283"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "二维点裁剪"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7522,
              "lineEnd": 7533,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4afa1e892de676e481c869acc1565287c64803b84736afa01d9f115c6f269fa3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-two-axis-intuition",
        "moduleId": "window-and-question",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：两个方向必须同时通过",
        "markdown": "可以把窗口看成 x 方向和 y 方向各有一个允许区间。点只有在水平方向落在 $[xw_{\\mathrm{min}}, xw_{\\mathrm{max}}]$ 内、同时竖直方向落在 $[yw_{\\mathrm{min}}, yw_{\\mathrm{max}}]$ 内，才真正位于矩形内部或边界上；任一方向越界，点就已经跑到窗口之外。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-window-assumption"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-retention-inequalities",
        "moduleId": "retention-condition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材保留条件（式 8.12）",
        "markdown": "若点 $P=(x,y)$ 同时满足下面两个条件，则保存该点用于显示：\n\n$$\nxw_{\\mathrm{min}} \\le x \\le xw_{\\mathrm{max}}\n$$\n\n$$\nyw_{\\mathrm{min}} \\le y \\le yw_{\\mathrm{max}}\n$$\n\n两个方向的条件合起来构成教材式 (8.12) 的完整判断。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000283"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "二维点裁剪"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7522,
              "lineEnd": 7533,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4afa1e892de676e481c869acc1565287c64803b84736afa01d9f115c6f269fa3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-boundary-is-inclusive",
        "moduleId": "retention-condition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：边界上的点算作可见",
        "markdown": "式中的 $\\le$ 表示闭区间：点恰好落在 $x=xw_{\\mathrm{min}}$、$x=xw_{\\mathrm{max}}$、$y=yw_{\\mathrm{min}}$ 或 $y=yw_{\\mathrm{max}}$ 时仍然满足条件，应保留而不是裁剪。边界点属于窗口，这一点在后续线段端点的测试中同样成立。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-retention-inequalities"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-point-check-example",
        "moduleId": "retention-condition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "模型补充：逐点判断算例",
        "markdown": "设窗口边界为 $xw_{\\mathrm{min}}=0$、$xw_{\\mathrm{max}}=10$、$yw_{\\mathrm{min}}=0$、$yw_{\\mathrm{max}}=8$。\n\n- $A=(5,4)$：$0 \\le 5 \\le 10$ 且 $0 \\le 4 \\le 8$，两个方向都满足，保留。\n- $B=(12,4)$：$12 \\le 10$ 不成立，裁剪。\n- $C=(10,8)$：等号成立，两个方向都满足，保留。\n- $D=(5,-1)$：$0 \\le -1$ 不成立，裁剪。\n\n判断过程只做四次比较，不涉及任何交点坐标计算。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-retention-inequalities"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-clip-rule",
        "moduleId": "boundary-and-misconceptions",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材裁剪规则：任一条件不满足即裁剪",
        "markdown": "如果上述不等式中有任何一个不满足，则裁剪掉该点：该点不会被存储，也不会被显示。也就是说，保留要求四个边界条件同时成立，而失败只需要一个条件不成立。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000283"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "二维点裁剪"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7522,
              "lineEnd": 7533,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4afa1e892de676e481c869acc1565287c64803b84736afa01d9f115c6f269fa3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-clipping-misconceptions",
        "moduleId": "boundary-and-misconceptions",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "模型补充：三个易错点",
        "markdown": "常见错误有三类：一是把边界点当成窗口外的点而提前裁剪，忽略了闭区间；二是只看 x 方向就下结论，漏掉 y 方向越界的情况；三是把点裁剪与线段裁剪混为一谈，以为要先求点与边界的交点。点裁剪本质上只是坐标比较，没有求交步骤。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-clip-rule",
            "textbook-retention-inequalities"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-particle-use",
        "moduleId": "particle-application",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "application",
        "title": "教材应用：粒子建模中的点裁剪",
        "markdown": "点的裁剪虽然不如线段或多边形裁剪使用得频繁，但在特定建模方式下仍然需要。教材给出的典型场景是用小圆或小球等粒子来建模云、海面泡沫、烟或爆炸，此时每个粒子都对应一个需要判断是否落在窗口内的点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000283"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "二维点裁剪"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7522,
              "lineEnd": 7533,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4afa1e892de676e481c869acc1565287c64803b84736afa01d9f115c6f269fa3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-line-clipping-bridge",
        "moduleId": "particle-application",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：作为线段裁剪的端点测试",
        "markdown": "点裁剪的判断还可以复用为线段裁剪的快速测试：先分别检查线段的两个端点。两个端点都在窗口内时整条线段可以保留；两个端点都落在同一条边界的外侧时可以整段清除；只有两个测试都失败时才需要进一步求交。因为点裁剪只需常数次比较，它常被放在更昂贵的求交计算之前作为筛选。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-particle-use",
            "textbook-retention-inequalities"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "final-check",
        "moduleId": "check-and-bridge",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "达成检查",
        "markdown": "窗口取 $xw_{\\mathrm{min}}=-1$、$xw_{\\mathrm{max}}=1$、$yw_{\\mathrm{min}}=-1$、$yw_{\\mathrm{max}}=1$，请判断下列点：\n\n1. $(-1,0)$\n2. $(1.2,0)$\n3. $(0.5,0.9)$\n4. $(0,-1.5)$\n\n逐点写出四条不等式的检查结果，并说明保留或裁剪的依据。参考答案：第 1、3 点保留（第 1 点位于边界上）；第 2 点因 $x$ 越界裁剪；第 4 点因 $y$ 越界裁剪。完成后尝试把这套判断用到一条线段的两个端点上，观察它能直接得出哪两种结论、何时仍需要求交。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-retention-inequalities",
            "textbook-clip-rule",
            "model-line-clipping-bridge"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
